ும்","parts":[{"text":"நின்றும்","lemma":"நின்றும்","gloss":"standing"}],"gloss":"standing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காண்டிரோ","parts":[{"text":"காண்டிரோ","lemma":"காண்டிரோ","gloss":"will you see?"}],"gloss":"will you see?","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வரவே","parts":[{"text":"வரவே","lemma":"வரவே","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"coming","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"O drummer who beats the tuṭi drum! / O low-born one who holds the drumstick! / Even if arrows pierce like seasonal rain, / even if spears flash like keṇṭai fish in the fields, / even if majestic elephants with gold-crafted forehead plates / press and gore with the tips of their shining, sword-like tusks, / great heroes who do not think of fleeing— / if they fall in battle, what is obtaining a fertile land / where vāḷai fish, leaping from deep-water ponds, flop at the base of granaries in tall houses filled with paddy? / They will surely enjoy marriage with flawless celestial maidens in the high-level world. Therefore, / stand here and watch the coming of the new king's army!","translation":"O drummer who beats the tuṭi drum! O low-born one who holds the drumstick! Even if arrows pierce like seasonal rain, even if spears flash like keṇṭai fish in the fields, and even if majestic elephants with gold-crafted forehead plates press and gore with the tips of their shining, sword-like tusks, great heroes will never flee. If they fall in battle, what is obtaining a fertile land where vāḷai fish, leaping from deep-water ponds, flop at the base of granaries in tall houses filled with paddy? They will surely enjoy marriage with flawless celestial maidens in the high heaven. Therefore, stand here and watch the coming of the new king's army!","modern":"துடி முழக்கும் புலையனே! முழக்கும் கோலை ஏந்திய இழிசினனே! பருவமழை போல அம்புகள் தைத்தாலும், வயல் கெண்டையைப் போல வேல்கள் பாய்ந்து சுழன்றாலும், பொன்னால் செய்த நெற்றிப்பட்டம் அணிந்த கம்பீரமான யானைகள் தம் ஒளிரும் தந்தங்களின் முனைகளை அழுத்திப் பாய்ச்சினாலும், போர்க்களத்திலிருந்து ஓடாத பெருமையுடைய வீரர்கள், போரில் வீழ்ந்தால், ஆழமான நீர்நிலைகளிலிருந்து துள்ளி விழும் வாளை மீன்கள் நெல் நிறைந்த பெரிய வீடுகளின் நெற்கூடுகளின் அடியில் புரளும் வளமான மருத நிலத்தைப் பெறுவது ஒரு பொருட்டா? அவர்கள் குற்றமற்ற வானுலக மகளிரோடு திருமணம் புரிந்து உயர்நிலை உலகத்தில் இன்பம் நுகர்வார்கள். அதனால், புதிய பகை வேந்தனின் படை வருவதை இங்கேயே நின்று காண்பாயாக!","explanation":"The speaker is a warrior addressing the drummer (pulaiyaṉ/iḻiciṉaṉ) on the battlefield as the enemy's army approaches. He boasts of the courage of his fellow warriors, declaring that they will never flee, even under a rain of arrows, flashing spears, or the goring tusks of majestic war elephants. He explains that if these brave heroes fall in battle, they do not merely gain fertile lands (taṇṇaṭai) in this world, where fish leap into granaries, but they will surely ascend to heaven to marry flawless celestial maidens. Therefore, he confidently tells the drummer to stand firm and watch the enemy's army advance. The poem belongs to the karantai tiṇai (cattle recovery/defense) and the nīṇmoḻi tuṟai (boastful declaration of valor), showcasing the heroic ethos of the Sangam era where death in battle was celebrated as the ultimate path to glory.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.4],[0.4,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.26,1.51],[1.51,2.0],[2.1,2.37],[2.5,3.05],[3.05,3.42],[3.42,3.82],[3.82,4.6],[4.6,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.83],[7.3,7.3],[7.3,8.1],[8.1,8.1],[8.1,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.02],[10.14,11.1],[11.1,12.0],[12.0,12.0],[12.0,12.5],[12.5,13.1],[13.1,14.1],[14.1,14.48],[14.63,14.79],[14.79,15.1],[15.8,16.5],[16.5,17.4],[17.4,18.1],[18.1,18.5],[18.5,19.4],[19.4,19.8],[19.8,19.8],[19.8,20.5],[20.5,21.2],[21.2,21.6],[21.6,21.6],[21.6,22.0],[22.0,23.2],[23.2,23.6],[23.6,23.6],[23.6,24.5],[24.5,25.1],[25.1,25.5],[25.5,25.9],[25.9,26.8],[26.8,26.8],[26.8,27.4],[27.4,27.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.4],[0.4,0.9],[0.98,1.3],[1.38,1.72],[1.72,2.4],[2.52,3.1],[3.1,4.1],[